# The port's own changes in the original locale (src/locale.lh): text the
# original never had, and captions reworded for them.

# The mode menu's labels, all three in one face (src/title.lh), over its
# background without the original's STORY MODE / VS MODE; PRACTICE MODE is
# the port's third item (TechnicalDocuments/0145).
